    skos:scopeNote "Use when child malnutrition or child undernutrition is explicit. ChildNutritionDisorders is the MeSH-defined ages 2 to 12 family that also includes overnutrition; use NutritionalStatus or FeedingPractices for measurements or dietary behavior that do not establish a disorder." ;
    ue:bearer <https://universalevidence.com/vocab/subjects/Population> .

